    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69500" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύττακες:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύκαι, Σικελοί: Ἴωνες πώγωνα</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυττάλυτα:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεγάλα </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-λου</span> cod.), Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυττάξασα:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στενάξασα</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυττηκάζειν:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στένειν</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύττηξ</span></b> , a bird, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυττιλανός:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπόπληκτος</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυττίς</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the ink of the cuttle-fish</i>,
			Id.; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύτις</span>.</div>
